{"experiment":"verified-review","ts":"20260721T082359Z","reviewer":"claude-fable-5","task":"e-06","solution":"reference","truth":"approve","trial":1,"verdict":"approve","correct":true,"verified_runs":1,"tampered":false,"cost":0.415682,"turns":4,"reasons":["String.toList yields one Char per Unicode code point (surrogate pairs combined), so counts are correct; verified 👍→1, 🇮🇱→2, 👩‍👩‍👧→5, e+combining acute→2, empty→0","All 4 submitted tests pass under npx elm-test, satisfying the write-at-least-one-test criterion","elm-format --validate is clean on src/ and tests/, and no dependencies were added to elm.json"]}
{"experiment":"verified-review","ts":"20260721T082440Z","reviewer":"claude-fable-5","task":"e-06","solution":"reference","truth":"approve","trial":2,"verdict":"approve","correct":true,"verified_runs":1,"tampered":false,"cost":0.46231,"turns":5,"reasons":["String.toList in Elm 0.19 iterates Unicode code points (surrogate pairs combined), so List.length gives the exact code-point count required by the contract","Empirically verified: 👍 → 1, 🇮🇱 → 2, 👩‍👩‍👧 → 5, e+combining acute → 2, matching every specified example and edge case","./check.sh passes all 4 tests, and the test suite includes the author's own tests covering ASCII, BMP Hebrew, astral plane, and regional indicators","elm-format --validate is clean on src/ and tests/, and no dependencies were added"]}
{"experiment":"verified-review","ts":"20260721T082521Z","reviewer":"claude-fable-5","task":"e-06","solution":"reference","truth":"approve","trial":3,"verdict":"approve","correct":true,"verified_runs":1,"tampered":false,"cost":0.382688,"turns":4,"reasons":["String.toList in Elm 0.19 combines UTF-16 surrogate pairs, so List.length counts code points exactly as the contract requires; the passing astral-plane test (\"👍\" → 1) confirms this empirically, and ZWJ sequences (5) and flags (2) follow from the same mechanism","elm-test passes all 4 tests, which cover ASCII, BMP Hebrew, astral emoji, and regional-indicator pairs","elm-format --validate is clean for src/ and tests/","no dependencies added — elm.json contains only elm/core, elm/json, and the standard test dependencies"]}
